WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
FearlessU is an early-stage concept. This prototype uses local rules.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Choose an everyday goal and a comfort level.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.100
Review one optional example. You do not need to carry it out.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.100
Mark a simulated result and reflect on the example.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.300
Choose a possible next step. No live AI or clinical outcome is shown.
